(1199, '重新设计；重新想办法', 'back to the drawing board', '习语', '进展', 3, 'This idea failed; it is back to the drawing board.', '这个想法失败了，得重新想办法。', 'adverb phrase', true, false, '/bæk tə ðə ˈdrɔɪŋ bɔrd/', 'C1'),
