(1212, '因祸得福的事', 'a blessing in disguise', '习语', '得失', 3, 'Missing that train was a blessing in disguise.', '错过那班火车反而成了一件好事。', 'noun phrase', true, false, '/ə ˈblɛsɪŋ ɪn dɪsˈɡaɪz/', 'C1'),
